- A **story** is a business goal, written as "As a…, I want…, so that…".
- A **feature** is a business capability that delivers part of a story.
- A **ticket** is a buildable, testable slice of one feature. Tickets are
  listed in build order: a ticket depends only on tickets listed before it.
